<title>POLAND: POLISH CIECHANOW TO ISSUE PLN 5.0 MLN MUNIBONDS.</title>
<headline>POLISH CIECHANOW TO ISSUE PLN 5.0 MLN MUNIBONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish central town of Ciechanow will issue 50,000 munibonds worth a total five million zlotys to finance repairs of roads and bridges in the town, PAP quoted Ciechanow councillors as saying.</p>
<p>The issue would be directed to 250 selected investors and the bonds would be due on December 31, 2002, PAP said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
